@startuml
!include ../style.puml
title Persistent tuple-space roots, radix nodes, and cold leaves
entity "{prefix}-roots" as Roots <<LMDB>> {
  current-root -> raw root hash
  raw root hash -> ASCII tag
  environment : {prefix}/history
}
entity "{prefix}-history" as History <<LMDB>> {
  * key : Blake2b-256 encoded node hash
  --
  value : compact radix node encoding
  environment : {prefix}/history
}
entity "Radix node" as Node {
  slots : 256 items
  item : Empty OR Leaf OR NodePtr
  prefix : byte path
  leaf value : cold leaf hash
  node pointer : child node hash
}
entity "{prefix}-cold" as Cold <<LMDB>> {
  * key : bincode Blake2b256Hash of leaf content
  --
  value : bincode PersistedData
  environment : {prefix}/cold
}
entity PersistedData {
  Data(DataLeaf)
  Continuations(ContinuationsLeaf)
  Joins(JoinsLeaf)
}
entity DataLeaf {
  bytes : serialized datums
  each datum : value, persist, Produce source
}
entity ContinuationsLeaf {
  bytes : serialized waiting continuations
  each : patterns, continuation, persist, peeks, Consume
}
entity JoinsLeaf {
  bytes : serialized channel lists
}
Roots --> History : root hash
History "1" --> "1" Node : decode
Node --> History : NodePtr child hashes
Node --> Cold : Leaf value hashes
Cold "1" --> "1" PersistedData : decode
PersistedData --> DataLeaf : alternative
PersistedData --> ContinuationsLeaf : alternative
PersistedData --> JoinsLeaf : alternative
legend bottom
prefix = rspace for chain state, eval for evaluator state.
Trie paths distinguish data, continuations, and joins before the channel hash.
Legacy mode uses rspace/casper/v2/{history,roots,cold,channels}, each named db.
Sources: roots_store.rs, radix_tree.rs, cold_store.rs, serializers.rs, rnode_key_value_store_manager.rs.
endlegend
@enduml
